      "writtenOn": "2025-05-16T21:09:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This TODO comment was added in https://aomedia-review.googlesource.com/c/aom/+/115761. In the old convention, we should use the username of the person who wrote the TODO comment. So we can change \"anyone\" to \"mufaddal.chakera\". If that doesn\u0027t work, we can use my username \"wtc\".\n\nIn the new convention, it is preferred to file a bug report for the to-do item and use the bug number here. If you have time, it is best to do that.\n\nAlternatively, we can remove \"TODO(anyone)\" and rephrase this comment as follows:\n\n\u003e The test below is disabled for mode 1 because mode 1 has low resolution screen content detection issues. ...",
      "revId": "e2986c456fc1ca059dd3f7e20472f327213b942e",
